1
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:17,000
Twenty years ago,

2
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,760
the Dragon-Seeking Zhang Family

3
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:22,440
led The Four Great Families of Wan-Mei-Qi-Sheng

4
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:24,160
to Wanglong Mountain

5
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:27,320
and found a moving Tidal Tomb.

6
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:30,760
That was a once-in-a-century grand tomb!

7
00:00:30,839 --> 00:00:34,640
But after that, the Dragon-Seeking Lineage vanished.

8
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:38,840
And bizarre events started piling up.

9
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:41,920
Cousin,

10
00:00:42,079 --> 00:00:44,320
did you bring our Qi family's Ghost-Suppressing Talisman?

11
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:47,439
Cousin, why use a butcher's knife on a chicken?

12
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:54,719
Tiankun,

13
00:00:55,119 --> 00:00:56,759
light a candle in the southwest corner.

14
00:00:57,039 --> 00:00:59,719
Let everyone witness our Qi family's

15
00:00:59,719 --> 00:01:01,719
authentic Ghost-Inquiring Door-Knocking.

16
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:03,320
Alright.

17
00:01:15,799 --> 00:01:17,000
Left on Azure Dragon to seek the tomb eye.

18
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,159
Right on White Tiger to set the gate.

19
00:01:18,159 --> 00:01:19,120
Open!

20
00:01:21,599 --> 00:01:23,439
Let's go, everyone.

21
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:32,959
Did I get it backwards?

22
00:01:35,599 --> 00:01:37,079
Right on Azure Dragon to seek the tomb eye.

23
00:01:37,079 --> 00:01:38,239
Left on White Tiger to set the gate.

24
00:01:38,239 --> 00:01:39,079
Open again!

25
00:01:59,359 --> 00:02:00,760
Don't be afraid, I'm here.

26
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:03,159
Zhang Tianyou, what are you doing?

27
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:19,879
Seal of Qian, Bearing Heaven. Awaken the spirit of Tianshu!

28
00:02:20,319 --> 00:02:23,840
Earth, respond and uphold. Shake the earth's axis!

29
00:02:25,039 --> 00:02:28,960
Spells open the mystic gate. Let the tomb door open!

30
00:02:34,879 --> 00:02:35,719
Young Master Qi.

31
00:02:36,039 --> 00:02:36,879
This door...

32
00:02:42,919 --> 00:02:44,360
opens inward.

33
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:47,479
I've raided countless tombs since I was a kid.

34
00:02:47,479 --> 00:02:49,159
How could I not know this door opens inward?

35
00:02:49,759 --> 00:02:50,639
Move aside, move aside, move aside!

36
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:53,120
Tiankun, mind your manners.

37
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:55,520
Let's go.

38
00:03:04,199 --> 00:03:07,159
Cousin, why is there a corridor behind this door?

39
00:03:07,159 --> 00:03:08,080
That's how it should be.

40
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:10,840
From my experience raiding tombs with my family,

41
00:03:11,199 --> 00:03:13,080
this means there's a code to this trade.

42
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:14,800
But,

43
00:03:15,039 --> 00:03:17,680
we usually have a rooster scout ahead for us.

44
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,360
Brother,

45
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:21,280
we don't have a rooster,

46
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:23,240
but we can make do with a useless fool.

47
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,000
Cousin,

48
00:03:24,199 --> 00:03:26,960
how about your man scouts ahead for us?

49
00:03:31,439 --> 00:03:33,360
Zhang Tianyou, you're my husband.

50
00:03:33,439 --> 00:03:34,919
Walk in front and protect me.

51
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,360
Don't embarrass our Sheng family.

52
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:39,120
Ling Yu, I've heard

53
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:41,680
that ghosts usually appear from behind.

54
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:42,759
I'm afraid...

55
00:03:44,599 --> 00:03:45,840
Brother, did you hear that?

56
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:48,319
This guy's probably wet his pants in fear.

57
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:51,599
Acting like this, he still wants to be the Sheng family son-in-law?

58
00:03:58,919 --> 00:04:00,240
It's a Step-String Trap.

59
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:05,719
Fine.

60
00:04:06,039 --> 00:04:09,000
Then don't regret it.

61
00:04:15,719 --> 00:04:16,519
Excuse me.

62
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:19,160
You...

63
00:04:36,399 --> 00:04:37,439
Young Master Qi.

64
00:04:37,639 --> 00:04:39,800
This is the solution to the Seven-Star Steps.

65
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:41,079
Such a basic trap

66
00:04:41,079 --> 00:04:43,360
should be a piece of cake for you, right?

67
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:45,000
Hey, just a friendly reminder.

68
00:04:45,279 --> 00:04:48,319
One wrong step and you'll be shot full of holes.

69
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:53,879
Such a basic trap,

70
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:56,120
I'm sure you two won't have any problems.

71
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:58,279
Then, Cousin, we'll go wait for you up ahead.

72
00:04:58,279 --> 00:04:59,079
Yeah.

73
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:01,000
You dirty rat, just you wait!

74
00:05:07,399 --> 00:05:09,079
Left one, right two.

75
00:05:09,319 --> 00:05:11,680
Left three, right four, left five, right six.

76
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:13,319
Then right seven.

77
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:15,839
Hmm.

78
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:16,800
Easy.

79
00:05:29,959 --> 00:05:30,759
Brother,

80
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:04,360
I feel like

81
00:06:05,759 --> 00:06:07,759
something is touching me from behind.

82
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:09,240
Brother!

83
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,720
Oh, don't be scared.

84
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:13,959
It's just touching you.

85
00:06:13,959 --> 00:06:15,000
It wouldn't dare touch me.

86
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:15,959
Brother!

87
00:06:18,399 --> 00:06:19,839
Tianyou, protect me!

88
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:21,399
Don't worry.

89
00:06:24,959 --> 00:06:28,439
Looks like I'll have to use my Qi family's Amulet

90
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:30,959
to show this monster a thing or two.

91
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:46,920
Done.

92
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:57,600
Why isn't this talisman working?

93
00:06:58,480 --> 00:06:59,279
What are you doing?

94
00:06:59,279 --> 00:07:00,639
Hey, stay back!

95
00:07:00,639 --> 00:07:01,560
Why are you chasing me?!

96
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:03,600
Ah! Why are you only chasing me?!

97
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:05,639
Tiankun!

98
00:07:05,839 --> 00:07:07,360
Why isn't the Amulet working anymore?

99
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,480
My brother's...

100
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:11,199
Dao Heart is broken.

101
00:07:12,319 --> 00:07:13,920
Don't come any closer!

102
00:07:14,319 --> 00:07:16,360
Why are you only chasing me?!

103
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,480
Help!

104
00:07:18,399 --> 00:07:18,920
Move!

105
00:07:20,519 --> 00:07:21,759
The wonders of Yin-Yang Reversal are endless.

106
00:07:21,759 --> 00:07:23,319
Two extremes return to the Nine Palaces.

107
00:07:23,319 --> 00:07:24,040
Freeze!

108
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,360
Smells so good!

109
00:07:54,199 --> 00:07:55,120
Baby,

110
00:07:56,079 --> 00:07:57,439
My little darling

111
00:07:58,879 --> 00:07:59,680
Baby

112
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,120
Cousin,

113
00:08:09,519 --> 00:08:12,720
Have you always wanted to marry me?

114
00:08:19,439 --> 00:08:20,240
Ling Yu,

115
00:08:43,039 --> 00:08:44,399
What just happened?

116
00:08:47,519 --> 00:08:49,600
I had my eyes closed the whole time.

117
00:08:50,039 --> 00:08:51,120
I didn't see anything.

118
00:08:54,799 --> 00:08:57,360
Then you missed a lot of excitement.

119
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:00,720
I've already subdued that female ghost.

120
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:01,519
Right over there.

121
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:03,000
She just knelt before me.

122
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:06,600
Cousin, that scared me to death just now.

123
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:09,559
I was just waiting for the Amulet to take effect.

124
00:09:09,679 --> 00:09:11,279
If this kid hadn't gotten in the way,

125
00:09:11,279 --> 00:09:13,639
I would've beaten that female ghost till her Soul scattered.

126
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:15,759
Bro.

127
00:09:15,759 --> 00:09:17,240
So that's how it is.

128
00:09:17,519 --> 00:09:19,519
Your tactical screaming just now

129
00:09:19,519 --> 00:09:21,159
almost fooled even me.

130
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:23,240
Cousin, you're amazing.

131
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:23,799
That's why I told you,

132
00:09:23,799 --> 00:09:25,039
that's why I told you,

133
00:09:25,039 --> 00:09:26,080
trivial matters like this

134
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:28,159
can't stop our Qi family.

135
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:31,159
You need to stay calm from now on.

136
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:34,039
Don't get scared to death so easily.

137
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,480
Let's go.

138
00:09:43,159 --> 00:09:43,960
Let me borrow this.

139
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:47,039
Hey, I saw it.

140
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:48,159
It's fine.

141
00:09:48,159 --> 00:09:49,120
I saw it.

142
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,759
That female ghost was kneeling to you.

143
00:09:53,559 --> 00:09:54,559
You saw it?

144
00:09:54,559 --> 00:09:55,360
I saw it.
